  "releaseNotes": "- Update Slapper.AutoMapper to 3.0.0\n- Breaking: Slapper 3.0.0 scopes instance caches to each mapping call, eliminating cross-query instance reuse and cache collisions. The default QueryMapper no longer shares or merges instances across queries, even for the same destination type and Id; keepCache and RemoveCacheAfterExecuteQuery no longer control cross-query instance reuse.\n- Multi-target: netstandard2.0, netstandard2.1, net47, net48, net6.0, net8.0, net9.0, net10.0",
